        "subject": "LU-18687 build: use native header name in lu_tgt_alloc.c",
        "message": "LU-18687 build: use native header name in lu_tgt_alloc.c\n\nlustre_compat shadows the kernel headers, so the kernel name already\nfinds the shim.  Include <linux/timer.h> rather than\n<lustre_compat/linux/timer.h>.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I7ca7232c23dc45576ca9b23e0beac1c66a6a6964\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
